WEBVTT

01:14.640 --> 01:18.280
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.200 --> 01:23.880
[Episode 12]

01:26.162 --> 01:27.772
Mr. Xie, Xiaochun.

01:28.562 --> 01:30.892
We just mentioned you.

01:31.202 --> 01:32.201
You're talking about me?

01:32.202 --> 01:33.051
What did you say?

01:33.052 --> 01:35.082
You're kind and active.

01:36.612 --> 01:38.131
Come out. I have something to say.

01:38.132 --> 01:39.332
I can't hear it?

01:41.922 --> 01:42.922
Come on.

01:44.002 --> 01:45.771
What made you so happy?

01:45.772 --> 01:47.922
It's a piece of great news.

01:48.252 --> 01:49.532
You found a rich man?

01:50.442 --> 01:51.441
Bingo.

01:51.442 --> 01:52.971
Bet whether we can make it,

01:52.972 --> 01:54.562
it depends on us now.

01:54.972 --> 01:56.442
Who is he?

01:57.082 --> 01:58.172
You look so happy.

01:58.412 --> 01:59.412
Tell me.

01:59.642 --> 02:01.531
Have you heard of Shaohua Bookstore?

02:01.532 --> 02:02.335
Yes.

02:02.336 --> 02:04.172
Its first store was in Beijing, I've been there.

02:04.532 --> 02:09.092
Then how about opening one in Yunmiao Village?

02:11.932 --> 02:13.441
What?

02:13.442 --> 02:14.651
That's great.

02:14.652 --> 02:15.652
Tell me about it.

02:17.132 --> 02:20.042
I'm hungry and want to eat
the braised chicken in Galsang Flower Restaurant.

02:20.442 --> 02:21.442
Let's go.

02:25.322 --> 02:26.492
Shaohua Bookstore?

02:27.092 --> 02:27.710
I've been there.

02:27.711 --> 02:28.851
There is one in Beijing.

02:28.852 --> 02:30.211
I went there with my friend.

02:30.212 --> 02:32.372
What's your impression of it?

02:32.932 --> 02:35.132
It's big with two or third floors.

02:35.372 --> 02:37.762
It's delicate and literary.

02:38.092 --> 02:39.092
It is special.

02:39.372 --> 02:41.652
The coffee and desserts are good.

02:41.652 --> 02:44.932
And there are many kinds of books and goods.

02:45.482 --> 02:46.482
It's interesting.

02:48.002 --> 02:50.002
Would it be attractive to you

02:50.282 --> 02:52.561
if we open one in Yunmiao Village?

02:52.562 --> 02:53.562
Of course.

02:53.932 --> 02:56.281
The bookstore
on Mount Qingcheng is about to open.

02:56.282 --> 03:00.091
And many travel bloggers want to visit there.

03:00.092 --> 03:03.492
And all the homestay hotels
around Mount Qingcheng were full.

03:03.812 --> 03:05.212
Mount Qingcheng?

03:05.478 --> 03:06.508
What's their specialty?

03:06.932 --> 03:07.851
Lady white snake.

03:07.852 --> 03:09.842
So they'll sell snake soup in the coffee shop?

03:12.042 --> 03:13.042
Childish.

03:16.282 --> 03:17.482
The main dish is not here yet.

03:17.482 --> 03:19.481
Don't just eat the milk cakes. Stop.

03:19.482 --> 03:20.482
I like it.

03:21.600 --> 03:22.894
You'll fart if eating too much.

03:25.132 --> 03:26.812
Enough nonsense.

03:26.812 --> 03:29.211
I don't understand what you just said.

03:29.212 --> 03:30.371
What's it about?

03:30.372 --> 03:32.371
So there is a bookstore,

03:32.372 --> 03:34.321
and there will be one here, right?

03:34.322 --> 03:36.091
I have a close senior brother.

03:36.092 --> 03:38.371
He is the classmate
of the founder in postgraduate school.

03:38.372 --> 03:41.371
I asked him to introduce me to the founder.

03:41.372 --> 03:44.251
I introduced him
the situation of Yunmiao Village.

03:44.252 --> 03:45.531
He is very interested,

03:45.532 --> 03:47.092
so he wants to investigate here.

03:48.412 --> 03:49.931
Investigate here?

03:49.932 --> 03:51.762
Then that's not settled.

03:52.252 --> 03:53.811
Don't say that.

03:53.812 --> 03:55.211
My senior brother said,

03:55.212 --> 03:57.092
if he is not very interested,

03:57.092 --> 03:59.042
he won't come here himself.

03:59.042 --> 04:00.811
He would send his assistant here.

04:00.812 --> 04:03.251
He made the first step forward.

04:03.252 --> 04:05.492
Should we finish the rest actively?

04:05.932 --> 04:08.531
So, we should
prepare in advance.

04:08.532 --> 04:09.761
I'll receive him,

04:09.762 --> 04:11.972
and let him fully know the geographic location,

04:11.972 --> 04:16.211
environmental advantages
and cultural characteristics of Yunmiao Village.

04:16.212 --> 04:16.771
Okay.

04:16.772 --> 04:18.772
Then I will explain the policy support

04:18.772 --> 04:20.571
provided to investors by rural revitalization,

04:20.572 --> 04:22.402
as well as some tax incentives.

04:23.852 --> 04:24.852
Hongdou.

04:25.412 --> 04:27.052
Help us to receive him.

04:28.092 --> 04:30.241
I've never received leaders.

04:30.242 --> 04:32.252
Only the leaders can receive leaders.

04:32.532 --> 04:34.411
Because you're not a local here.

04:34.412 --> 04:35.121
You're a tourist,

04:35.122 --> 04:37.801
so they'll think what you say is objective.

04:37.802 --> 04:39.241
And we don't know how many people they are,

04:39.242 --> 04:40.522
so we need help.

04:45.972 --> 04:46.921
Come on.

04:46.922 --> 04:50.132
Let Auntie Huailan make
some clothes for us to wear when receiving him.

04:51.092 --> 04:52.092
Well,

04:52.212 --> 04:53.921
what do you mean by us?

04:53.922 --> 04:55.252
You're also included.

04:55.772 --> 04:56.971
Let me tell you, Hongdou.

04:56.972 --> 04:59.801
I saw Ms. Xie make a suit for Gezi.

04:59.802 --> 05:00.972
It's specially made for him.

05:00.972 --> 05:02.211
It's very beautiful.

05:02.212 --> 05:04.801
There is embroidery on the collar.

05:04.802 --> 05:06.801
The only one in the
world, no clothing clashing.

05:06.802 --> 05:07.531
Yes.

05:07.532 --> 05:10.202
They wore formally to attend
the Intangible Cultural Heritage Exhibition.

05:11.532 --> 05:13.361
Then we should hurry up to make clothes.

05:13.362 --> 05:14.681
We should get prepared.

05:14.682 --> 05:15.531
Let's go after lunch.

05:15.532 --> 05:16.411
Okay.

05:16.412 --> 05:17.481
Okay.

05:17.482 --> 05:18.562
The braised chicken.

05:18.922 --> 05:19.572
Wow.

05:19.572 --> 05:20.242
Here.

05:20.242 --> 05:21.492
Enjoy it.

05:21.772 --> 05:23.411
Thank you, Aunt Hua.

05:23.412 --> 05:24.851
You're welcome.

05:24.852 --> 05:25.852
I'll have a try.

05:47.212 --> 05:50.932
You kept Ms. Xie's work,
you want to open an exhibition for her?

05:52.092 --> 05:55.211
Craftsmen like Ms. Xie
with more than ten years of experience,

05:55.212 --> 05:56.692
their works are sensible.

05:57.012 --> 05:58.612
They are works of art.

05:59.802 --> 06:00.891
As a local artist,

06:00.892 --> 06:02.292
she can surely open an exhibition.

06:04.092 --> 06:06.172
What is Ms. Xie's child doing?

06:06.802 --> 06:07.932
She is not married yet.

06:10.242 --> 06:11.242
Why?

06:12.092 --> 06:14.292
Ms. Xie went to the Old Town
when she was eighteen.

06:14.572 --> 06:15.812
She met a Frenchman.

06:16.412 --> 06:19.402
The Frenchman is a painter
who comes to China to visit.

06:19.652 --> 06:21.891
He fell in love with Ms. Xie at the first sight,

06:21.892 --> 06:23.612
and invited her to be his model.

06:49.412 --> 06:53.121
The painter painted many portraits for Ms. Xie.

06:53.122 --> 06:56.292
Then Ms. Xie fell in love with him.

06:57.012 --> 06:58.492
Why did they break up?

07:00.332 --> 07:02.082
That painter wanted to go back to France.

07:02.332 --> 07:03.612
He told Ms. Xie,

07:04.122 --> 07:07.372
I love you, if you love
me, just go with me.

07:08.092 --> 07:09.612
Then Ms. Xie asked him,

07:10.012 --> 07:11.012
I love you,

07:11.212 --> 07:13.292
if you love me, just stay here.

07:14.012 --> 07:15.692
That Frenchman kept silent.

07:16.652 --> 07:17.962
Ms. Xie said,

07:19.092 --> 07:21.531
if you can't do that,
don't ask me to do that,

07:21.532 --> 07:23.402
because love is equal.

07:24.572 --> 07:26.011
If you want to prove you love me,

07:26.012 --> 07:27.692
you need to sacrifice more for me.

07:27.972 --> 07:29.241
That's right.

07:29.242 --> 07:32.121
Then Ms. Xie didn't
fall in love with anyone else,

07:32.122 --> 07:33.402
so she didn't get married.

07:33.802 --> 07:36.202
But, she has been
doing the things she likes.

07:36.602 --> 07:38.921
She likes embroidery,
likes teaching students.

07:38.922 --> 07:40.642
So, she is enjoying her life.

07:42.282 --> 07:43.882
Your ice cream is melting.

07:45.042 --> 07:45.851
Give it to me.

07:45.852 --> 07:46.852
Do you have a tissue?

07:47.162 --> 07:48.098
No.

07:48.122 --> 07:49.122
Give it to me.

07:50.362 --> 07:51.362
Just wipe it here.

07:51.602 --> 07:52.642
I'll wash it later.

07:59.572 --> 08:00.882
I shouldn't walk this way.

08:01.452 --> 08:02.281
Yang Xu.

08:02.282 --> 08:03.282
Yao.

08:03.452 --> 08:04.452
She is?

08:04.602 --> 08:05.361
My friend.

08:05.362 --> 08:06.762
This is Tuotuo's dad.

08:07.482 --> 08:09.161
Hello, Tuotuo's dad.

08:09.162 --> 08:10.162
Hello.

08:10.362 --> 08:11.361
When will you leave?

08:11.362 --> 08:12.041
Recently.

08:12.042 --> 08:14.202
My wife went to rent a house.

08:14.682 --> 08:16.322
Did Tuotuo know you won't take him?

08:17.122 --> 08:18.481
Just hide it from him.

08:18.482 --> 08:19.595
He'll cry if we tell him.

08:21.922 --> 08:23.132
He'll be unhappy.

08:24.533 --> 08:25.851
We can do nothing about it.

08:25.852 --> 08:26.851
Okay.

08:26.852 --> 08:28.571
- I'll invite you to dinner before I left.
- Okay.

08:28.572 --> 08:29.291
I shall leave now.

08:29.292 --> 08:30.292
Bye-bye.

08:38.692 --> 08:39.692
What's wrong?

08:41.482 --> 08:42.972
It's okay, let's go.

08:45.482 --> 08:46.932
Tuotuo, eat more,

08:46.932 --> 08:49.092
or you can't eat it when you go to Kunming.

08:51.052 --> 08:52.092
Kunming?

08:52.692 --> 08:54.282
Who said Tuotuo will go to Kunming?

08:54.722 --> 08:56.172
His parents will go there.

08:56.172 --> 08:58.451
Tuotuo doesn't want to go there.

08:58.452 --> 09:00.642
But he has nothing to do with it.

09:01.812 --> 09:03.002
Don't worry, Tuotuo.

09:03.292 --> 09:05.051
Your parents won't take you with them.

09:05.052 --> 09:07.452
You can just stay here
with grandparents and go to school.

09:07.932 --> 09:10.402
Uncle Guanjun, you're lying.

09:10.722 --> 09:11.852
No.

09:12.242 --> 09:13.642
Your dad told me about it.

09:14.002 --> 09:16.522
You'll go to school here like Huzi.

09:16.932 --> 09:19.121
Four friends will stay together.

09:19.122 --> 09:20.122
Don't worry.

09:20.292 --> 09:21.601
Really, dad?

09:21.602 --> 09:22.571
Really?

09:22.572 --> 09:23.572
Yes.

09:32.722 --> 09:33.852
What's wrong, Tuotuo?

09:35.172 --> 09:36.452
Why are you crying?

09:37.242 --> 09:37.692
Okay, okay.

09:37.692 --> 09:39.402
Don't cry.

09:40.452 --> 09:41.572
What's wrong with you?

09:42.722 --> 09:43.762
What's wrong, Tuotuo?

09:44.122 --> 09:46.171
You'll stay together, right?

09:46.172 --> 09:46.932
Okay, okay.

09:46.932 --> 09:47.932
Don't cry.

09:54.332 --> 09:57.452
What's the difference with this employee manual?

09:58.052 --> 09:59.332
It will make a difference.

09:59.972 --> 10:01.452
You shall not be late or leave early.

10:03.522 --> 10:05.171
You shall not be late or leave early,

10:05.172 --> 10:06.401
or ask for leave randomly.

10:06.402 --> 10:08.572
Then you can get
200 yuan more every month, understand?

10:08.932 --> 10:11.291
There should have been an employee manual before.

10:11.292 --> 10:13.452
That girl is so nice.

10:14.172 --> 10:16.571
Don't just hear the advantages Baoping said.

10:16.572 --> 10:18.691
How could they make such an employee manual,

10:18.692 --> 10:21.051
just to give us more money?

10:21.052 --> 10:23.852
They just added a full-attendance bonus reward.

10:24.812 --> 10:26.811
Your salary will be reduced if you leave early.

10:26.812 --> 10:28.091
If you can't reach the standard,

10:28.092 --> 10:30.451
your salary will also be reduced.

10:30.452 --> 10:31.172
Xiaochun said,

10:31.172 --> 10:33.612
big companies in the cities are all like this.

10:33.882 --> 10:36.691
Is this manual good or bad?

10:36.692 --> 10:39.212
It's hard to say that.

10:39.642 --> 10:41.162
We just need to work hard.

10:45.052 --> 10:48.922
Is Xu Hongdou working in the cafe?

10:49.172 --> 10:50.931
Xiaochun said she is a volunteer.

10:50.932 --> 10:54.401
People living in the yard are not normal people.

10:54.402 --> 10:55.651
They got bored living in cities,

10:55.652 --> 10:57.171
so they relax here.

10:57.172 --> 10:58.571
Even if it's that Nana,

10:58.572 --> 11:00.332
she couldn't live here for a long time.

11:00.642 --> 11:03.492
The youngsters in the village are moving outside.

11:03.812 --> 11:04.788
Well,

11:04.812 --> 11:07.612
Yang Xu and his wife are also leaving.

11:07.932 --> 11:09.612
They didn't tell their kid.

11:09.932 --> 11:12.612
Tuotuo knew about it last night.

11:13.292 --> 11:14.452
He cried for a long time.

11:15.452 --> 11:17.372
So does Huzi.

11:18.052 --> 11:20.051
His parents got back during the spring festival.

11:20.052 --> 11:21.332
He didn't recognize them.

11:21.812 --> 11:23.332
It's not like that.

11:23.642 --> 11:26.811
Mr. Xie and Xiaochun are also capable,

11:26.812 --> 11:28.051
but they came back.

11:28.052 --> 11:29.332
And Huang Xinxin.

11:29.572 --> 11:33.211
She became an officer here after graduation.

11:33.212 --> 11:35.331
She focused on the development here.

11:35.332 --> 11:37.051
She said if the village develops well,

11:37.052 --> 11:38.572
people will come back.

11:40.172 --> 11:41.572
The idea is good,

11:42.452 --> 11:44.881
but it's hard to say whether she can make it.

11:44.882 --> 11:47.451
This is the first step of the long march.

11:47.452 --> 11:49.572
But we've finished the long march.

11:50.812 --> 11:53.691
Wait and see if the long march
can be over when you're my age.

11:53.692 --> 11:55.682
Don't just discourage them.

11:55.932 --> 11:59.042
Youngsters should have
someone to tell them the cruel truth.

11:59.332 --> 12:00.802
It's not that simple, right?

12:03.052 --> 12:04.052
Aunt Baoping,

12:04.172 --> 12:06.451
did Xiaochun tell you the story about

12:06.452 --> 12:08.051
Mr. Xie and Xu Hongdou at home?

12:08.052 --> 12:08.971
What is it?

12:08.972 --> 12:09.571
Yes.

12:09.572 --> 12:10.452
What is it?

12:10.452 --> 12:12.171
My granny told me,

12:12.172 --> 12:14.572
Mr. Xie listens to whatever she said.

12:15.052 --> 12:16.571
No way.

12:16.572 --> 12:19.092
And he always takes her to eat in the restaurant.

12:19.572 --> 12:22.051
It must be expensive to eat in a restaurant.

12:22.052 --> 12:23.052
Yes.

12:24.052 --> 12:25.852
Then he surely likes her.

12:31.292 --> 12:32.521
My dad said,

12:32.522 --> 12:33.881
he'll come back with aunt this time.

12:33.882 --> 12:34.882
Yuan won't come back.

12:35.402 --> 12:36.932
He left too much homework behind,

12:36.932 --> 12:37.932
so he needs to study.

12:40.052 --> 12:41.052
Granny,

12:41.172 --> 12:42.332
are you listening to me?

12:44.212 --> 12:45.572
What are you thinking?

12:46.972 --> 12:47.972
Yao.

12:48.172 --> 12:50.452
Tell me the truth.

12:51.292 --> 12:53.931
You asked Xu Hongdou to help me,

12:53.932 --> 12:55.612
and invited her to eat here.

12:55.882 --> 12:58.252
Do you like her?

12:59.642 --> 13:01.452
She thinks you look like her granny,

13:01.452 --> 13:03.091
so she likes to be with you.

13:03.092 --> 13:06.641
Besides, I also invited
Nana to eat at our home.

13:06.642 --> 13:09.401
Nana came with Xiaochun.

13:09.402 --> 13:11.211
And she only came twice.

13:11.212 --> 13:13.931
And you said nothing much with her.

13:13.932 --> 13:16.401
You treat Xu Hongdou differently.

13:16.402 --> 13:19.212
You also bought rice noodles for her.

13:19.452 --> 13:21.641
That's the condition
I offered her to be a volunteer.

13:21.642 --> 13:22.641
I'll buy her meals.

13:22.642 --> 13:23.642
Buy her meals?

13:24.692 --> 13:26.802
Then why doesn't he give you money directly?

13:28.092 --> 13:29.571
I have money to buy meals.

13:29.572 --> 13:31.252
Of course, he should buy delicious food for me.

13:32.402 --> 13:35.971
Then why did he take you
to see the birth of the foal alone?

13:35.972 --> 13:37.212
The birth of the foal.

13:38.052 --> 13:40.572
I should show her what's not in the city.

13:40.812 --> 13:42.571
She's been playing with the cat every day.

13:42.572 --> 13:44.092
I guess she likes animals.

13:45.052 --> 13:46.881
When you are looking at her,

13:46.882 --> 13:49.212
even your eyes are smiling.

13:52.052 --> 13:53.372
He'll smile at everyone.

13:53.762 --> 13:56.452
He is happier when he meets you.

13:58.212 --> 13:59.811
I'm a volunteer.

13:59.812 --> 14:02.092
If I were him, I'm
happier than him.

14:04.572 --> 14:05.691
If a man and a woman are together,

14:05.692 --> 14:07.331
do they have to be a couple?

14:07.332 --> 14:08.852
I'm not here to find a boyfriend.

14:12.402 --> 14:14.291
Don't think too much.

14:14.292 --> 14:15.331
No.

14:15.332 --> 14:16.332
It's not like that.

14:16.812 --> 14:21.452
I just think she is nice and kind.

14:22.172 --> 14:25.051
But she'll go back soon.

14:25.052 --> 14:26.332
Don't think too much.

14:26.692 --> 14:28.881
I like her.

14:28.882 --> 14:31.051
You can like her, but it is none of my business.

14:31.052 --> 14:32.691
I think you also like her.

14:32.692 --> 14:34.972
I just like her as a friend.

14:35.452 --> 14:37.572
You like her.

14:39.052 --> 14:40.171
I can help you.

14:40.172 --> 14:41.252
Don't do that,

14:42.212 --> 14:43.922
or she won't come to our home.

14:45.052 --> 14:46.212
Don't do that.

14:47.452 --> 14:48.361
Wait.

14:48.362 --> 14:49.362
A phone call.

14:58.812 --> 15:00.051
Hello, Mr. Ma.

15:00.052 --> 15:01.052
What's wrong?

15:02.572 --> 15:03.972
I'm helping my granny.

15:05.692 --> 15:07.572
Okay, see you later.

15:11.172 --> 15:12.172
Let's go.

15:15.572 --> 15:16.378
Go.

15:16.402 --> 15:17.402
Okay.

15:22.932 --> 15:24.732
I should water the succulents today.

15:31.522 --> 15:33.252
Why isn't he sitting there today?

15:34.452 --> 15:35.452
Strange.

15:37.172 --> 15:38.172
Jiahui.

15:46.292 --> 15:48.452
Why do I feel this is...

15:58.172 --> 15:59.172
Please.

16:06.932 --> 16:07.971
Good tea.

16:07.972 --> 16:09.212
Give me some next time.

16:09.762 --> 16:10.762
Okay.

16:17.172 --> 16:18.172
Mr. Xie.

16:18.692 --> 16:19.732
I came here,

16:20.692 --> 16:22.162
to ask you something.

16:23.292 --> 16:24.292
Say it.

16:24.522 --> 16:26.452
Where do young men go,

16:27.092 --> 16:28.492
when they are dating?

16:29.572 --> 16:30.572
The cafe.

16:30.812 --> 16:33.572
Where do they go when they discuss work?

16:34.332 --> 16:35.332
The cafe.

16:35.522 --> 16:38.852
Where do they go
when they want to chat and start a business?

16:39.292 --> 16:41.092
Is this some kind of brainteaser?

16:41.332 --> 16:42.612
Still the cafe.

16:44.052 --> 16:46.332
Why not go to the teahouse?

16:47.172 --> 16:48.852
The tea is good.

16:49.572 --> 16:50.852
And in China,

16:51.172 --> 16:53.972
there are more people drinking tea.

16:58.202 --> 16:59.202
Well,

17:00.292 --> 17:01.722
you don't ask me why?

17:02.682 --> 17:05.162
Do you need me to call
Ye Sen here to cooperate with you?

17:06.812 --> 17:07.572
It's serious.

17:07.572 --> 17:09.161
Don't joke with me.

17:09.162 --> 17:11.442
I can't wait anymore.

17:13.572 --> 17:15.442
You've been staying here for more than a year.

17:15.682 --> 17:18.202
It's time that you want
to start a business again.

17:20.292 --> 17:21.332
Let me tell you,

17:23.922 --> 17:25.202
in my mind,

17:25.882 --> 17:27.572
the ideas of starting a business,

17:28.162 --> 17:30.242
are booming,

17:31.252 --> 17:32.432
like mushrooms after rain.

17:32.922 --> 17:35.092
You can't suppress them.

17:37.402 --> 17:39.372
I sit there every day,

17:39.962 --> 17:40.962
and meditate.

17:41.772 --> 17:44.572
I want to let go of all ideas.

17:45.572 --> 17:47.092
If I can't let them go,

17:47.572 --> 17:51.962
I'll use the writing brush
to write them on the Xuan paper every night.

17:52.332 --> 17:55.202
Then I'll burn the incense and paper.

17:55.442 --> 17:57.962
Let them go with the wind.

17:59.812 --> 18:01.442
But there is one idea.

18:02.052 --> 18:04.612
It has been existing in my mind.

18:05.052 --> 18:07.161
The more I think, the clearer it will be.

18:07.162 --> 18:09.442
The more I think, the
more concrete my idea is.

18:10.442 --> 18:13.092
When I close my eyes every day,

18:13.332 --> 18:18.332
I would think how
to position and market a new tea shop...

18:18.332 --> 18:20.332
Then how to finance,

18:20.572 --> 18:22.332
open branches and enter the market.

18:24.682 --> 18:26.402
I didn't think that much.

18:26.922 --> 18:27.962
I was just thinking,

18:28.442 --> 18:31.482
how many branches I can open in the country.

18:33.772 --> 18:35.881
So you want to open a tea shop

18:35.882 --> 18:39.361
where people can chat and date?

18:39.362 --> 18:40.362
Yes.

18:40.732 --> 18:41.731
Since there are cafes,

18:41.732 --> 18:43.052
why can't there be tea shops?

18:44.362 --> 18:45.682
I've had an investigation.

18:46.252 --> 18:49.601
Now there are some new tea shops

18:49.602 --> 18:52.612
aiming at developing
the third space in the market.

18:52.962 --> 18:53.962
But,

18:54.682 --> 18:56.202
the target is not clear,

18:56.442 --> 18:58.052
so they didn't achieve great success.

18:58.642 --> 19:04.372
There is still much room for development,
optimization and improvement.

19:06.772 --> 19:07.772
Tell me about it.

19:08.162 --> 19:09.162
Okay.

19:10.202 --> 19:12.772
I'll explain it to you carefully.

19:15.012 --> 19:17.962
I like tea.

19:19.202 --> 19:23.242
And I know a little about Chinese tea culture.

19:25.922 --> 19:28.922
But to be honest, people now,

19:29.442 --> 19:30.682
especially young people,

19:31.642 --> 19:32.922
don't know much about tea.

19:33.402 --> 19:35.121
At this time,

19:35.122 --> 19:37.372
they need professional people like us

19:37.732 --> 19:40.402
to identify the good tea for them,

19:40.642 --> 19:44.012
and to match the most appropriate boiling method,

19:44.642 --> 19:49.442
then they can fully appreciate
the charm of tea and tea culture.

19:50.492 --> 19:51.961
And most importantly,

19:51.962 --> 19:53.962
we should keep pace with the times.

19:54.922 --> 19:57.771
We should include all the non-pure tea drinks

19:57.772 --> 20:00.882
that meet the tastes and needs of young people.

20:02.492 --> 20:03.642
So,

20:04.732 --> 20:07.921
you want to enlarge the concept of tea?

20:07.922 --> 20:08.922
Exactly.

20:09.442 --> 20:10.772
We won't set barriers,

20:11.012 --> 20:12.372
nor pretend to be elegant.

20:13.492 --> 20:14.418
Mr. Xie.

20:14.442 --> 20:17.642
Chinese tea culture should be young,

20:17.962 --> 20:19.962
and should be rejuvenated.

20:20.682 --> 20:24.772
Tea culture must spread
in every corner of the space.

20:25.362 --> 20:27.681
If you want it, you can get it.

20:27.682 --> 20:28.921
If you're not interested,

20:28.922 --> 20:30.202
you'll gradually like it.

20:31.202 --> 20:32.202
This is how it works.

20:36.162 --> 20:39.121
Where do you want to open the first shop?

20:39.122 --> 20:40.642
It must be a big city,

20:41.162 --> 20:42.402
like Beijing, Shanghai,

20:42.642 --> 20:43.922
Guangzhou or Shenzhen.

20:44.362 --> 20:47.121
But it has to develop steadily.

20:47.122 --> 20:50.882
We must build
the brand influence of this first shop.

20:52.532 --> 20:54.961
Will you make
peripheral products at the same time?

20:54.962 --> 20:59.091
Yes, and they must be placed
in the shop where people can easily get.

20:59.092 --> 21:01.052
If you are interested in it, you can get it.

21:06.332 --> 21:08.372
If the first shop succeeds,

21:08.882 --> 21:11.242
you can open the branches.

21:12.122 --> 21:16.402
The market prospect and space may be pretty good.

21:18.362 --> 21:19.362
Mr. Xie.

21:20.252 --> 21:23.202
You think I can start this business?

21:23.682 --> 21:25.882
I'm not responsible for investment evaluation now.

21:26.492 --> 21:27.492
I know that.

21:27.922 --> 21:31.482
But, you don't like my
project or invest money.

21:32.962 --> 21:35.722
It turns out my judgment was right.

21:36.162 --> 21:37.162
And this one?

21:38.642 --> 21:41.201
Have you ever thought,
there are so many ideas,

21:41.202 --> 21:42.881
why did you choose this?

21:42.882 --> 21:43.882
Yes.

21:44.492 --> 21:45.882
Because I like it.

21:46.442 --> 21:49.402
This is something I really want to do.

21:50.882 --> 21:52.292
You're not catering to the public?

21:52.922 --> 21:54.491
Definitely not.

21:54.492 --> 21:55.921
That's good.

21:55.922 --> 21:57.251
Industry revitalizes the country.

21:57.252 --> 21:58.292
I think,

21:58.882 --> 21:59.882
you can have a try.

22:01.882 --> 22:03.202
You won't discourage me?

22:03.732 --> 22:05.251
If you get started,

22:05.252 --> 22:07.491
the problems will show up themselves.

22:07.492 --> 22:08.722
I don't need to do that.

22:09.602 --> 22:11.401
And as for starting a business,

22:11.402 --> 22:12.881
you're more experienced,

22:12.882 --> 22:15.921
whether it's a success or failure experience.

22:15.922 --> 22:18.202
About this, I should
learn from you.

22:20.642 --> 22:21.642
That's right.

22:23.122 --> 22:24.881
Okay, that's a deal.

22:24.882 --> 22:25.162
Okay.

22:25.162 --> 22:27.052
I'll make the plan, you find investment.

22:28.442 --> 22:29.442
Okay.

22:29.732 --> 22:30.732
Nice.

22:32.492 --> 22:33.612
First of all,

22:34.122 --> 22:36.962
I want to build a research and development team.

22:38.012 --> 22:40.682
I may need some fees at the beginning.

22:41.682 --> 22:42.681
Of course.

22:42.682 --> 22:43.682
Yes,

22:44.092 --> 22:45.242
but I have no money.

22:46.602 --> 22:47.961
Why are you looking at me?

22:47.962 --> 22:48.921
I have no money.

22:48.922 --> 22:49.922
You...

22:50.332 --> 22:51.682
You're a president.

22:51.682 --> 22:52.681
You...

22:52.682 --> 22:54.251
What are you doing?

22:54.252 --> 22:56.161
You're blaming me?

22:56.162 --> 22:56.882
You have money,

22:56.882 --> 22:58.881
you sold your house in Beijing to pay the debt.

22:58.882 --> 22:59.492
You...

22:59.492 --> 23:01.482
Don't mention that.

23:02.922 --> 23:03.922
Drink the tea.

23:07.852 --> 23:09.442
Tea culture?

23:17.012 --> 23:17.881
Is he in this class?

23:17.882 --> 23:18.402
No.

23:18.402 --> 23:19.201
The class behind.

23:19.202 --> 23:20.202
He doesn't come out.

23:21.402 --> 23:22.681
You haven't seen him for half a year?

23:22.682 --> 23:23.362
Yes.

23:23.362 --> 23:25.402
I don't know if I can recognize him.

23:26.332 --> 23:27.011
Here he is.

23:27.012 --> 23:27.442
Really?

23:27.442 --> 23:28.442
That class.

23:28.922 --> 23:30.732
Gather here, kids.

23:30.732 --> 23:31.442
And keep it in order.

23:31.442 --> 23:32.442
Huzi!

23:32.732 --> 23:33.962
Huzi!

23:34.362 --> 23:35.362
Huzi!

23:36.772 --> 23:38.242
I'm your mom.

23:38.882 --> 23:40.961
He doesn't know what to do now.

23:40.962 --> 23:43.642
I'm your mom. He dares not to recognize me.

23:45.122 --> 23:46.402
I'm your mom.

23:50.402 --> 23:52.441
Huzi, there are too many cars.

23:52.442 --> 23:53.882
Let me hold your hand, okay?

23:54.492 --> 23:55.492
Let me hold your hand.

23:58.012 --> 23:58.681
Huzi.

23:58.682 --> 23:59.491
Don't run.

23:59.492 --> 24:00.492
It's dangerous.

24:04.682 --> 24:07.132
Be careful.

24:23.682 --> 24:24.331
I knew it.

24:24.332 --> 24:25.771
When you're back,

24:25.772 --> 24:27.642
they would drink a lot together.

24:27.882 --> 24:28.731
Have they gone to sleep?

24:28.732 --> 24:30.251
Yes, and so did Huzi.

24:30.252 --> 24:31.601
Come on, I'll wash it.

24:31.602 --> 24:32.962
It's okay, it's almost finished.

24:35.852 --> 24:37.482
Why are you crying?

24:38.602 --> 24:39.602
I'm fine.

24:40.122 --> 24:40.851
What's wrong?

24:40.852 --> 24:42.052
Tell me about it.

24:43.122 --> 24:44.532
Did anything happen?

24:44.852 --> 24:46.772
Mom, don't think too much.

24:46.772 --> 24:47.772
I'm fine.

24:48.122 --> 24:48.731
Really?

24:48.732 --> 24:50.402
Then why are you crying?

24:54.402 --> 24:56.532
I went to pick Huzi up today.

24:58.252 --> 25:00.442
He... he didn't recognize me,

25:00.442 --> 25:01.962
and he wouldn't let me hold his hand.

25:03.012 --> 25:05.372
He is not close to us anymore.

25:07.492 --> 25:08.492
Here.

25:08.850 --> 25:09.850
Wipe your tears.

25:10.962 --> 25:12.012
Don't be sad.

25:12.602 --> 25:14.372
It's no big deal.

25:14.732 --> 25:15.812
Here, wipe it.

25:17.332 --> 25:18.532
Let me tell you,

25:19.122 --> 25:22.531
raising kids is like raising dogs.

25:22.532 --> 25:24.091
After you stay here for three days,

25:24.092 --> 25:25.722
he'll be close to you.

25:27.092 --> 25:28.601
Here, wipe it.

25:28.602 --> 25:29.921
Don't take it seriously.

25:29.922 --> 25:31.961
Huzi is still little.

25:31.962 --> 25:34.482
When he grew up,
he'll understand.

25:35.642 --> 25:36.641
Really?

25:36.642 --> 25:37.642
Yes.

25:43.732 --> 25:46.402
Actually, he also missed you.

25:46.732 --> 25:48.882
He is just feeling shy.

25:49.442 --> 25:51.772
When you were not
here, he would ask,

25:52.442 --> 25:54.532
when will my mom come back?

25:56.122 --> 25:57.121
Really?

25:57.122 --> 25:58.122
Yes.

26:00.442 --> 26:02.532
He wants the new GG Bond, right?

26:06.362 --> 26:07.532
You really know about him.

26:09.122 --> 26:11.682
Are you comforting me or not, mom?

26:11.682 --> 26:12.442
I'm comforting you.

26:12.442 --> 26:13.852
Really.

26:19.332 --> 26:20.482
What else?

26:21.332 --> 26:22.251
GG Bond.

26:22.252 --> 26:23.641
GG Bond.

26:23.642 --> 26:25.122
My dad will give me delicious food,

26:25.122 --> 26:27.441
when he comes back to see me.

26:27.442 --> 26:29.731
And he'll buy many story books for me.

26:29.732 --> 26:30.732
Yes, Tuotuo.

26:30.732 --> 26:33.441
Call them if you need anything.

26:33.442 --> 26:35.442
Do you miss them?

26:36.252 --> 26:36.732
No.

26:36.732 --> 26:39.052
A real man won't cry tears.

26:39.332 --> 26:41.771
I want my parents to work outside,

26:41.772 --> 26:44.442
then I can play with my phone every day.

26:46.362 --> 26:48.441
Let me change a flavor for you.

26:48.442 --> 26:49.642
Is it delicious?

26:51.732 --> 26:52.732
Aunt Gui.

26:52.962 --> 26:54.331
Try these egg cakes.

26:54.332 --> 26:55.482
Aunt E gave me these.

26:55.882 --> 26:56.531
Not me.

26:56.532 --> 26:57.922
I'm busy, you can eat it.

26:58.442 --> 26:59.161
Forget it.

26:59.162 --> 27:00.292
I'll try some.

27:05.852 --> 27:06.492
Just a second.

27:06.492 --> 27:07.492
Wait for me.

27:08.442 --> 27:10.162
Take your time, and be careful.

27:11.442 --> 27:12.442
Be careful.

27:14.602 --> 27:15.771
Sorry, sorry.

27:15.772 --> 27:16.641
I got up late.

27:16.642 --> 27:17.642
It's okay.

27:17.962 --> 27:19.431
I'm not used to letting others wait.

27:19.852 --> 27:22.121
You're so serious as a consultant.

27:22.122 --> 27:24.161
You made everyone else
feel embarrassed to be lazy.

27:24.162 --> 27:24.682
Yes.

27:24.682 --> 27:26.491
The eunuch is anxious, instead of the emperor.

27:26.492 --> 27:27.921
You're at least a maid.

27:27.922 --> 27:29.052
The eunuch isn't here yet.

27:30.012 --> 27:31.292
You didn't sleep well tonight?

27:32.202 --> 27:33.011
Don't mention it.

27:33.012 --> 27:34.881
My sister called me at midnight.

27:34.882 --> 27:37.881
She asked me to send birthday blessings
for my mom at the exact time.

27:37.882 --> 27:39.292
Then I couldn't fall asleep,

27:39.682 --> 27:41.132
so I watched a movie.

27:41.852 --> 27:43.121
Your sister is so strange.

27:43.122 --> 27:44.201
She doesn't sleep?

27:44.202 --> 27:47.132
She doesn't sleep,
not before 1 o'clock.

27:47.442 --> 27:48.961
She is so busy with work.

27:48.962 --> 27:49.962
No.

27:50.162 --> 27:53.372
She plays with her phone
for two hours before going to sleep.

27:53.732 --> 27:54.922
Retaliatory entertainment.

27:55.362 --> 27:56.362
Strange lady.

27:57.682 --> 27:58.641
Let's start.

27:58.642 --> 27:59.491
Wait.

27:59.492 --> 28:01.682
I'll call the eunuch to see where he is.

28:06.962 --> 28:07.962
I'm here.

28:08.772 --> 28:10.162
Don't call me, I'm here.

28:16.962 --> 28:18.292
You're just here?

28:19.012 --> 28:20.011
See?

28:20.012 --> 28:22.012
This is our unique work style here.

28:22.602 --> 28:24.402
You've met him before, right?

28:24.642 --> 28:26.132
Our artistic designer, Ye Sen.

28:26.362 --> 28:27.612
He is smart.

28:28.362 --> 28:29.491
Let's get started.

28:29.492 --> 28:30.201
Okay.

28:30.202 --> 28:31.091
The leader first.

28:31.092 --> 28:32.851
Then I'll show you a comic monologue first,

28:32.852 --> 28:34.771
All About Comedy, okay?

28:34.772 --> 28:37.132
That's a comic dialogue.

28:37.442 --> 28:38.961
Okay, enough.

28:38.962 --> 28:40.442
Let's be serious.

28:40.882 --> 28:42.641
We mainly discuss the preliminary preparations

28:42.642 --> 28:45.851
for the reception
of the boss of Shaohua Bookstore today.

28:45.852 --> 28:47.642
And I want to ask for your opinions.

28:47.642 --> 28:49.922
Besides high-quality
resources like Shaohua Bookstore,

28:49.922 --> 28:52.012
do we have any other methods to attract tourists?

28:53.162 --> 28:55.292
I'll say my opinion first.

28:55.772 --> 28:58.851
There is a middle-end
homestay hotel in our village now.

28:58.852 --> 29:01.242
There is also a high-end
homestay hotel under construction.

29:01.922 --> 29:03.851
People can experience
tie-dye in the Tie-dye workshop.

29:03.852 --> 29:05.962
We can teach lessons in the embroidery workshop.

29:06.922 --> 29:09.012
There are stud farms and campsites.

29:09.532 --> 29:11.121
The infrastructure is complete.

29:11.122 --> 29:14.442
We can let the tourists stay here
for two days and one night.

29:15.122 --> 29:16.122
Besides,

29:16.202 --> 29:18.372
I want to make a short promotional video,

29:18.922 --> 29:20.612
to show these features,

29:21.332 --> 29:23.201
and post it on the Internet.

29:23.202 --> 29:26.402
And it can be displayed in our yard.

29:26.682 --> 29:28.491
Compared with the leaflets,

29:28.492 --> 29:31.331
I think this can better
attract people's attention.

29:31.332 --> 29:33.292
I think this is a great idea.

29:33.772 --> 29:35.921
There will be a bookstore here,

29:35.922 --> 29:38.722
so I want to make
this promotional video as early as possible.

29:38.962 --> 29:40.722
We can make the video with villagers.

29:41.202 --> 29:43.202
Huang can act in it.

29:43.532 --> 29:44.601
People can follow Huang

29:44.602 --> 29:46.851
to experience the interesting items,

29:46.852 --> 29:48.441
the natural scenery, delicious food,

29:48.442 --> 29:49.961
and some intangible cultural heritage arts.

29:49.962 --> 29:50.962
Wait,

29:51.362 --> 29:52.612
why me?

29:53.492 --> 29:55.201
Because you're active and cute,

29:55.202 --> 29:56.812
and are friendly to people.

30:00.052 --> 30:01.332
Okay.

30:01.732 --> 30:03.601
As long as it is useful for development,

30:03.602 --> 30:05.922
just ask me to do whatever you want.

30:06.682 --> 30:07.601
I've thought about it.

30:07.602 --> 30:09.482
The theme of the video

30:09.922 --> 30:12.132
is Meet Yourself.

30:14.162 --> 30:15.682
Why is this theme?

30:15.922 --> 30:16.922
Explain it.

30:18.732 --> 30:22.011
This yard is called Youfeng Yard (Windy Yard),

30:22.012 --> 30:25.091
because we hope everyone who lives here

30:25.092 --> 30:27.922
to find the power of happiness in life.

30:28.202 --> 30:30.771
The essence of wind is the flow of air.

30:30.772 --> 30:33.441
Wind is formed when cold air flows to hot air,

30:33.442 --> 30:35.681
then everything in the world has vitality.

30:35.682 --> 30:37.442
Without wind,
everything is lifeless.

30:37.682 --> 30:39.531
Birds will go to the south for the winter.

30:39.532 --> 30:41.771
When people are feeling cold,

30:41.772 --> 30:44.161
they will go to warm places,

30:44.162 --> 30:47.681
to look for the power of happiness, beauty,

30:47.682 --> 30:50.202
and starting again.

30:56.962 --> 30:59.202
Huang, do you have any questions?

31:00.922 --> 31:03.442
I think it's a good idea,

31:03.732 --> 31:09.011
but the budget in our village...

31:09.012 --> 31:10.012
Don't worry.

31:10.252 --> 31:11.482
I'll find investment.

31:12.122 --> 31:13.682
That's exactly what I want.

31:14.602 --> 31:16.092
Then that's a deal.

31:16.642 --> 31:17.642
Ye Sen.

31:18.012 --> 31:19.012
Say something.

31:20.922 --> 31:22.012
I need to think about it.

31:24.162 --> 31:25.251
Haven't you prepared?

31:25.252 --> 31:27.532
I want to brainstorm here.

31:28.732 --> 31:30.161
Why did you bring a notebook?

31:30.162 --> 31:32.121
It's just a tool for the meeting.

31:32.122 --> 31:33.482
Xu Hongdou, am I right?

31:33.962 --> 31:36.202
No, I'm prepared.

31:37.202 --> 31:39.601
You're just a consultant.

31:39.602 --> 31:42.161
Yes, so I didn't prepare much.

31:42.162 --> 31:43.292
Just about ten points.

31:45.252 --> 31:46.531
I'm worried that

31:46.532 --> 31:49.162
this bad social atmosphere
of working-too-hard will influence us.

31:49.402 --> 31:51.052
Xinxin, am I right?

31:51.492 --> 31:52.251
Yes.

31:52.252 --> 31:53.482
I think,

31:54.602 --> 31:57.441
when you're in the
meeting, it will be chatting.

31:57.442 --> 31:58.442
Shut up.

31:59.882 --> 32:00.962
Hongdou, just say it.

32:01.642 --> 32:02.681
I'm thinking,

32:02.682 --> 32:05.601
our online shop will send
many packages every day, right?

32:05.602 --> 32:11.162
If we put a leaflet
of Yunmiao Village in every package,

32:11.442 --> 32:14.921
it will leave an impression on the customers.

32:14.922 --> 32:18.681
When they want to
travel, or come to Dali,

32:18.682 --> 32:20.962
maybe they will come here.

32:21.602 --> 32:22.251
This is good.

32:22.252 --> 32:23.252
We can implement it.

32:24.362 --> 32:26.642
Well, if we want to
make a promotional video,

32:26.642 --> 32:29.491
we can add a QR Code on the leaflet.

32:29.492 --> 32:30.722
People can scan and watch it.

32:31.122 --> 32:31.731
Right.

32:31.732 --> 32:34.012
It would be better. I was just thinking about it.

