33:48.202 --> 33:49.202
Granny.

33:49.332 --> 33:50.682
It's too bright outside.

33:50.922 --> 33:52.161
It's bad for your eyes.

33:52.162 --> 33:54.681
It's good for me.

33:54.682 --> 33:56.962
If I do nothing, I'll get old faster.

33:57.402 --> 33:58.722
You'll be blind.

34:01.362 --> 34:02.362
Well,

34:02.402 --> 34:03.402
I mean,

34:04.132 --> 34:06.282
it will cause serious consequences.

34:07.212 --> 34:08.921
If you watch the mobile phone in the quilt,

34:08.922 --> 34:09.922
will you be blind?

34:10.692 --> 34:12.362
You watch the computer under so bright light,

34:12.362 --> 34:13.452
will you be blind?

34:13.852 --> 34:17.242
I think you'll be blind soon.

34:21.482 --> 34:23.691
Just play with me.

34:23.692 --> 34:25.972
I'm talking with you.

34:27.252 --> 34:28.972
Talking is also a way of playing?

34:29.612 --> 34:30.441
Granny.

34:30.442 --> 34:31.922
When you are not working,

34:31.922 --> 34:33.412
what do you like to do?

34:33.652 --> 34:35.722
I'll visit neighbors.

34:36.402 --> 34:37.642
You won't play mahjong?

34:38.692 --> 34:41.362
I've been working for my whole life.

34:41.922 --> 34:42.972
I never played.

34:43.732 --> 34:45.052
When I was young,

34:46.652 --> 34:49.722
I can't even be full or wear warm clothes.

34:50.522 --> 34:52.171
Whether it's an adult or a child,

34:52.172 --> 34:53.972
they were all starving.

34:54.212 --> 34:56.452
They just work for food.

34:57.922 --> 35:01.202
I liked singing when I was young.

35:01.732 --> 35:04.762
Yao's grandpa was good at singing.

35:05.882 --> 35:08.452
When we were tired of working in the field,

35:08.692 --> 35:10.492
he would sing for me.

35:11.172 --> 35:13.452
If he went fishing in the sea,

35:13.732 --> 35:15.972
I would wait for him at the bank.

35:16.482 --> 35:18.162
He would come back, singing.

35:20.732 --> 35:22.052
It's so beautiful.

35:26.652 --> 35:31.322
Yao had an uncle before.

35:33.292 --> 35:36.892
But his lips were purple when he was born.

35:38.212 --> 35:39.492
When he was five years old,

35:40.562 --> 35:41.802
he can't breathe,

35:42.882 --> 35:44.572
when he was running.

35:46.332 --> 35:49.921
The hospital told us
there is a hole in his heart.

35:49.922 --> 35:51.132
It's congenital.

35:51.852 --> 35:53.202
The hospital can't cure it.

35:53.732 --> 35:55.002
It's not as advanced as present days.

35:55.002 --> 35:56.202
We had no medical insurance.

35:56.922 --> 35:59.202
We borrowed much money,

35:59.482 --> 36:03.322
and we didn't pay off the money
we borrowed for our wedding.

36:04.252 --> 36:08.842
At that time, Yao's dad was just a baby.

36:09.732 --> 36:10.732
So,

36:12.652 --> 36:15.242
I need to work hard.

36:18.042 --> 36:19.572
This is my whole life,

36:20.922 --> 36:21.922
I never played.

36:34.482 --> 36:35.482
Granny.

36:35.732 --> 36:36.731
Wait for me.

36:36.732 --> 36:37.732
I'll fetch something.

36:38.882 --> 36:39.892
Wait for me.

37:04.212 --> 37:07.092
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

37:08.042 --> 37:09.611
I didn't master it yet.

37:09.612 --> 37:10.612
Again.

37:10.962 --> 37:11.292
Again.

37:11.292 --> 37:12.292
Okay, again.

37:15.852 --> 37:18.399
♫ I take out a pen ♫

37:18.400 --> 37:21.252
♫ What can I do ♫

37:21.253 --> 37:25.412
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

37:29.700 --> 37:32.492
♫ Mung beans are delicious ♫

37:33.772 --> 37:35.162
Again.

37:36.442 --> 37:38.612
I'll choose the blue one.

37:41.029 --> 37:43.824
♫ And the tower is tall ♫

37:43.825 --> 37:46.652
♫ With a slim figure ♫

37:46.653 --> 37:51.012
♫ My baby, let's go to sleep ♫

37:55.112 --> 37:57.852
♫ And the tower is tall ♫

37:59.522 --> 38:00.932
You cheated.

38:01.252 --> 38:03.811
Granny, this is a
technical problem.

38:03.812 --> 38:05.041
This is not mahjong.

38:05.042 --> 38:06.242
How do I cheat?

38:07.812 --> 38:09.881
The lunch will be ready in ten minutes.

38:09.882 --> 38:11.001
What are you playing?

38:11.002 --> 38:12.611
Saving the Penguin from breaking the ice.

38:12.612 --> 38:15.202
I just got it, and wanted
it to give to Tuotuo.

38:17.562 --> 38:19.412
Why is granny unhappy?

38:20.442 --> 38:21.442
She lost.

38:22.132 --> 38:23.722
She cheated.

38:24.772 --> 38:27.012
Granny, you can't
cheat when playing this.

38:28.772 --> 38:30.731
Or you can play with Yao.

38:30.732 --> 38:31.652
Okay, come on.

38:31.652 --> 38:32.652
Come on.

38:37.482 --> 38:38.851
Which color do you want?

38:38.852 --> 38:40.202
I want red.

38:41.482 --> 38:42.561
White, white.

38:42.562 --> 38:43.932
I'll knock it first.

38:56.812 --> 38:57.441
See?

38:57.442 --> 38:58.442
You're experienced.

38:59.002 --> 38:59.811
Again.

38:59.812 --> 39:00.812
Again.

39:10.922 --> 39:12.081
Granny.

39:12.082 --> 39:14.012
You're a master of it now.

39:15.732 --> 39:16.521
Again.

39:16.522 --> 39:17.522
Okay.

39:41.482 --> 39:43.092
Did you two cheat?

39:43.772 --> 39:45.811
This is a technical problem.

39:45.812 --> 39:46.921
This is not mahjong.

39:46.922 --> 39:48.441
How do I cheat?

39:48.442 --> 39:50.331
It must be Hongdou.

39:50.332 --> 39:51.802
Can't you afford to lose?

39:53.082 --> 39:55.362
You cheated, and you
taught granny to cheat.

39:57.612 --> 39:58.921
She is angry because I told the truth.

39:58.922 --> 40:00.202
You're more like a granny.

40:00.922 --> 40:01.961
I won't play with you two.

40:01.962 --> 40:03.532
Let's have lunch now.

40:04.082 --> 40:06.932
You're so bad at playing.

40:07.362 --> 40:09.282
He can't afford to lose.

40:09.612 --> 40:11.052
He became anxious.

40:11.882 --> 40:13.362
He became anxious.

40:15.612 --> 40:18.081
You finally have a few months' vacations.

40:18.082 --> 40:19.682
Now you're working there.

40:20.082 --> 40:21.612
How much does he pay you?

40:22.252 --> 40:23.131
I'm a volunteer.

40:23.132 --> 40:24.762
I think it's meaningful.

40:25.042 --> 40:26.322
And he offers me meals.

40:27.402 --> 40:28.402
Oh, no.

40:28.522 --> 40:30.642
You were brainwashed by him.

40:31.252 --> 40:34.251
Capitalists are good at brainwashing.

40:34.252 --> 40:35.762
Do you need his meal?

40:36.292 --> 40:38.242
Or does he offer you any delicious food?

40:39.332 --> 40:41.532
Yes, it's delicious food.

40:43.002 --> 40:46.092
Those who can brainwash Dou
are not ordinary people.

40:46.772 --> 40:48.481
She is a volunteer this time.

40:48.482 --> 40:52.131
We need to save her
from a pyramid-selling gang next time.

40:52.132 --> 40:53.921
Great, my sister.

40:53.922 --> 40:56.842
Then I can be brainwashed without hesitation.

40:58.612 --> 41:00.642
I won't be angry with whatever you said.

41:01.042 --> 41:03.612
Just say what you like, I'm not angry.

41:04.812 --> 41:05.961
You made much progress.

41:05.962 --> 41:09.921
I'll say, you should
walk out and relax,

41:09.922 --> 41:11.762
Your mind will be broadened, right?

41:12.852 --> 41:13.731
Mom.

41:13.732 --> 41:16.041
I sent you the fried
termite mushroom oil

41:16.042 --> 41:19.651
and dried boletus
made by Granny Xie.

41:19.652 --> 41:21.132
Remember to receive it.

41:21.962 --> 41:23.441
How can I eat that?

41:23.442 --> 41:24.557
I'll send you the recipe.

41:25.252 --> 41:27.002
Well, I'll go to eat something.

41:27.002 --> 41:28.001
It's ready.

41:28.002 --> 41:29.521
You eat midnight snacks?

41:29.522 --> 41:30.762
You'll be fat.

41:31.732 --> 41:33.132
Thank you for your blessing.

41:33.362 --> 41:34.362
Bye-bye.

41:34.442 --> 41:35.611
Go to sleep early.

41:35.612 --> 41:36.561
Bye-bye.

41:36.562 --> 41:37.562
Bye-bye.

41:46.252 --> 41:47.001
Is it ready, Hongdou?

41:47.002 --> 41:48.001
Yes.

41:48.002 --> 41:49.540
I'll ask if Damai will eat it with us.

41:50.252 --> 41:51.252
Watch the pot.

42:17.772 --> 42:18.892
Nana.

42:19.772 --> 42:20.892
Nana.

